#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/extension_contracts.md:57
msgid "Reuse an existing semantic parameter before adding a new key. In the live database, `138` YAML files (`134` in the base `relic` tier with `4,642` leaf entries and `4` in the `calibrated` tier with `109` leaf entries, totaling `4,751` leaf entries) load `4,643` default runtime parameters (`810` with `requires_grad=True`). Physical constants reside exclusively in `relic\\parameters\\database\\relic\\physical\\constants.yaml` and are accessed through `get_physical_constant(...)`. When a process is replaced or merged, remove or explicitly deprecate orphaned keys; do not keep two namespaces for the same quantity."
msgstr "新增参数键之前，应优先复用现有的语义参数。在当前数据库中，`138` 个 YAML 文件（基础 `relic` 层含 `134` 个文件、`4,642` 个叶条目，`calibrated` 层含 `4` 个文件、`109` 个叶条目，合计 `4,751` 个叶条目）共加载 `4,643` 个默认运行时参数（其中 `810` 个设置 `requires_grad=True`）。物理常数仅存放在 `relic\\parameters\\database\\relic\\physical\\constants.yaml` 中，并通过 `get_physical_constant(...)` 访问。替换或合并过程时，应移除或显式废弃孤立键，不得为同一物理量保留两个命名空间。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/extension_contracts.md:67
msgid "Variable contract extension"
msgstr "Variable contract 扩展"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/extension_contracts.md:69
msgid "Add variable contracts under `relic\\contracts\\variables\\` using the existing schema. Declare canonical name, kind, units, aliases, owner, permitted writers, increment behavior, flux whitelist, conservation tolerances, and domain membership as applicable."
msgstr "使用现有 schema，在 `relic\\contracts\\variables\\` 下添加 variable contract。根据需要声明 canonical name、kind、units、aliases、owner、permitted writers、increment behavior、flux whitelist、conservation tolerances 和 domain membership。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/extension_contracts.md:74
msgid "Ownership is not inferred from output names. Optional externally supplied state uses no production owner, no increment permission, and explicit provenance. When configuration selects one implementation from a closed set, selection is proved by the existing graph or bundle construction path; do not add a conditional-owner registry."
msgstr "ownership 不能根据 output 名称推断。可选的外部供给 state 不设置 production owner，不授予 increment permission，并且必须提供显式 provenance。当 Configuration 从封闭集合中选择一个实现时，应由现有 graph 或 bundle 构建路径证明该选择；不得添加 conditional-owner registry。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/extension_contracts.md:80
msgid "Graph and adapter extension"
msgstr "Graph 与 adapter 扩展"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/extension_contracts.md:82
msgid "Extend `GraphIR`, `PortSpec`, `NodeRegistry`, `validator.py`, and `compiler.py` only when the capability belongs to orchestration. Preserve the single serialized graph and issue models."
msgstr "仅当能力属于 orchestration 时，才扩展 `GraphIR`、`PortSpec`、`NodeRegistry`、`validator.py` 和 `compiler.py`。必须保留唯一的 serialized graph 与 issue model。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/extension_contracts.md:86
msgid "An adapter is executable only when it is represented by authored runtime behavior. Compiler recommendation metadata is not sufficient. Adapters must not infer missing scientific closure, conservation, ownership, or effort-flow pairing."
msgstr "只有在 adapter 由明确编写的 Runtime 行为表示时，它才可执行。compiler 的建议 metadata 并不足够。adapter 不得推断缺失的科学 closure、守恒、ownership 或 effort-flow 配对。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/extension_contracts.md:91
msgid "External extension paths"
msgstr "外部扩展路径"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/extension_contracts.md:93
msgid "Python and manifest-based extensions use `relic\\extensions\\` and `relic_extension.yaml`. Language-agnostic C ABI and shared-library coupling uses `PluginHost` and `PluginFunctorAdapter` under `relic\\coupling\\plugin\\`."
msgstr "基于 Python 和 manifest 的扩展使用 `relic\\extensions\\` 与 `relic_extension.yaml`。与语言无关的 C ABI 和 shared-library coupling 使用 `relic\\coupling\\plugin\\` 下的 `PluginHost` 与 `PluginFunctorAdapter`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/extension_contracts.md:98
msgid "After loading, both paths rejoin the same Functor registration, `UnifiedParameterManager`, dependency, simulator, and `StateManager` lifecycle."
msgstr "加载后，两条路径都会重新汇入相同的 Functor registration、`UnifiedParameterManager`、dependency、simulator 和 `StateManager` lifecycle。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/extension_contracts.md:101
msgid "Scientific structure claims"
msgstr "科学结构声明"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/extension_contracts.md:103
msgid "A process may claim only the level supported by its executable path and `IPHSEquivalenceCertificate`. In the live repository, `90` unique concrete scientific `Functor` classes are registered across the four canonical bridge families (`BiologicalProcessFunctor`: `37`, `TransportMechanismFunctor`: `27`, `PhysicalFieldFunctor`: `14`, `ScaleCouplingFunctor`: `12`; `0` uncertified) and are backed by `92` YAML certificates: a primary 90-class distribution across Levels 0 through 5 of `4 / 15 / 39 / 32 / 0 / 0`, plus `2` secondary `constructor_selection` certificates bringing the 92-certificate totals to `4 / 15 / 39 / 32 / 1 / 1`. Typed cochains (`CochainSpaceSpec`), linear chain maps (`LinearChainMap`, validated in `__post_init__` for two-dimensional matrix rank, `(target.n_dofs, source.n_dofs)` shape, finite entries, and positive `unit_factor`), Hodge star specifications (`HodgeStarSpec`), and declared IPHS operators (`IPHSStructureSpec`) provide structural contracts, not automatic scientific closure."
msgstr "过程仅能声明其可执行路径与 `IPHSEquivalenceCertificate` 所支持的等级。在当前代码库中，四个规范桥接族共注册 `90` 个唯一的具体科学 `Functor` 类（`BiologicalProcessFunctor`：`37`，`TransportMechanismFunctor`：`27`，`PhysicalFieldFunctor`：`14`，`ScaleCouplingFunctor`：`12`；未认证数为 `0`），由 `92` 份 YAML 证书支撑：`90` 个类主证书在 Level 0 至 Level 5 上的分布为 `4 / 15 / 39 / 32 / 0 / 0`，另加 `2` 份次级 `constructor_selection` 证书后，`92` 份证书总计分布为 `4 / 15 / 39 / 32 / 1 / 1`。类型化上链（`CochainSpaceSpec`）、线性链映射（`LinearChainMap`，在 `__post_init__` 中校验二维矩阵阶数、`(target.n_dofs, source.n_dofs)` 形状、有限元素及正值 `unit_factor`）、Hodge 星算子规范（`HodgeStarSpec`）以及已声明的互连端口哈密顿系统（Interconnected Port-Hamiltonian System, IPHS）算子（`IPHSStructureSpec`）提供结构化契约，本身并不构成科学闭合证明。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/extension_contracts.md:118
msgid "For reaction and matter-transformation processes, verify actual donor and recipient increments, units, support, time integration, external exchanges, and exactly one state advance. Where a process declares and uses `N r`, its single production path must evaluate that declared operator and rates; closed ledgers verify `C N=0`, and open exchanges require routed amounts on the same unit/support/time basis. A mature pool model without an `N r` representation verifies its actual increments and physical budget directly; it must not invent identity stoichiometry to satisfy an unrelated claim. Clipping and overflow remain explicit, and dependencies use metadata, ports, chain maps, or `IntegrationPlan`."
msgstr "对于反应与物质转化过程，须验证实际的 donor 与 recipient 增量、单位、support、时间积分、外部交换，以及恰好一次状态推进。当一个过程声明并使用 `N r` 时，其唯一的生产路径必须对该已声明的 operator 与速率求值；闭合账本验证 `C N=0`，开放交换则要求在相同单位/support/时间基准上给出路由量。没有 `N r` 表示的成熟池模型直接验证其实际增量与物理收支；它不得为满足无关声明而虚构恒等化学计量。Clipping 与 overflow 保持显式，依赖关系使用 metadata、port、chain map 或 `IntegrationPlan`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/extension_contracts.md:129
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Strict dissipative-pH and GENERIC claims are conditional on the corresponding runtime point and governed process-certificate witness: `FickianDiffusion(strict_runtime_point=True, spatial_dims=1)` at Level 4 (`{strict_runtime_point: true, spatial_dims: 1}`) and `ChemistryFunctor(physical_boundary=\"closed_constant_volume\")` at Level 5 (`{physical_boundary: closed_constant_volume}`). Both are documented in [Scientific Structure and Extensions API](api/scientific_structure_extensions.md). Ordinary graph `strict=True` validates the declared graph contract; it does not by itself request strict IPHS or authorize a broader thermodynamic claim."
msgstr "严格耗散端口哈密顿（dissipative-pH）与广义非平衡可逆-不可逆耦合方程（General Equation for Non-Equilibrium Reversible-Irreversible Coupling, GENERIC）声明以对应的运行时点及受治理过程证书见证为前提：Level 4 的 `FickianDiffusion(strict_runtime_point=True, spatial_dims=1)`（`{strict_runtime_point: true, spatial_dims: 1}`）以及 Level 5 的 `ChemistryFunctor(physical_boundary=\"closed_constant_volume\")`（`{physical_boundary: closed_constant_volume}`）。两者均记录于 [科学结构与扩展 API](api/scientific_structure_extensions.md)。常规图的 `strict=True` 仅校验已声明的图契约，本身既不请求严格 IPHS，也不授权更宽泛的热力学声明。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/extension_contracts.md:139
msgid "Explicit unavailable scientific boundaries"
msgstr "显式声明不可用的科学边界"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/extension_contracts.md:141
msgid "Four public scientific entries are currently non-operational: `EmissionInventory` (`runtime_domain_unbound`), `AtmosphereCoupling` (`runtime_dependency_unbound`), `AnthroposphereInterfaceMapping` (`runtime_metadata_domain_unbound`), and `IsotopeHeartbeatFunctor` (`runtime_unbound`). Constructors and `forward(...)` reject before state or output effects, including an unsafe constructor bypass. Empty runtime I/O/ports are the unavailable contract, not successful zero-valued models."
msgstr "目前有四个公开的科学条目不可运行：`EmissionInventory`（`runtime_domain_unbound`）、`AtmosphereCoupling`（`runtime_dependency_unbound`）、`AnthroposphereInterfaceMapping`（`runtime_metadata_domain_unbound`）和 `IsotopeHeartbeatFunctor`（`runtime_unbound`）。构造函数与 `forward(...)` 在产生状态或输出效果之前即拒绝，包括不安全的构造函数绕过。空的 runtime I/O/port 表示的是不可用 contract，而不是成功的零值模型。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/extension_contracts.md:149
msgid "Re-enablement requires, respectively: source-bound target-domain inventory fractions and allocation; provenance-bound six-species providers in the same graph; exact SCM/official-CF/unit/support/coordinate and governed consumer binding; and isotope component UpdateItems with complete transfer routes, parent-process time ownership, and restart behavior. Their class presence and Level 0 records do not establish runnable processes. The generated science reference is the per-class source-backed detail."
msgstr "重新启用分别需要：绑定到来源的目标 domain 清单分数与分配；同一 graph 中绑定 provenance 的六物种 provider；精确的 SCM/官方 CF/单位/support/坐标以及受治理的 consumer 绑定；以及具有完整转移路由、父过程时间所有权和重启行为的同位素组分 UpdateItem。它们的 class 存在与 Level 0 记录并不能确立可运行的过程。生成的科学参考是逐 class、有源码支撑的详细说明。"

