#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/extension_contracts.md:169
msgid "An extension is complete only when its contract, owner, runtime path, and configuration agree. Successful import or graph compilation alone is not evidence of executed scientific behavior."
msgstr "只有当扩展的 contract、owner、Runtime 路径和 Configuration 一致时，该扩展才算完成。仅成功 import 或编译 graph，不能证明科学行为已实际执行。"

